								</a></li><li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li><li id="media_group_377290_images_download" class="dropdown-header"><h6 class="mb-0">Images</h6></li><li><a id="media_group_377290_download_images_0" class="dropdown-item" href="/vis/a000000/a005100/a005196/dyamondPointCloud_12-4-2023b_dyamond_co2_anim_globe_tilt_3x3Hyperwall.01085_print.jpg" target="_blank">
									dyamondPointCloud_12-4-2023b_dyamond_co2_anim_globe_tilt_3x3Hyperwall.01085_print.jpg (1024x576) [126.5 KB]
								</a></li><li><a id="media_group_377290_download_images_1" class="dropdown-item" href="/vis/a000000/a005100/a005196/dyamondPointCloud_12-4-2023b_dyamond_co2_anim_globe_tilt_3x3Hyperwall.01085_searchweb.png" target="_blank">
									dyamondPointCloud_12-4-2023b_dyamond_co2_anim_globe_tilt_3x3Hyperwall.01085_searchweb.png (320x180) [82.0 KB]
